flowchart TD
  O[Organization] --> P[Problem]
  HP[Historical Projects] --> P
  P --> IB[Idea Bounty / Escrow #1]
  IB --> IS[Private Idea Submissions]
  IS --> IW[Idea Winner]
  IW --> RI[Restricted Idea]
  IW --> R1[Reward]
  RI --> BB[Build Bounty / Escrow #2]
  BB --> BP[Exact-terms Build Participant]
  BP --> PP[Private Projects]
  PP --> PS[Immutable Project Submissions]
  PS --> PW[Project Winner]
  PW --> RP[Restricted Project]
  PW --> R2[Reward]
  RP --> IN[Optional Interview]
  RP --> CT[Optional Contract]

  PUB[Public Problem / Idea / Project] --> Q[Contextual Quote Posts]
  Q --> H[Home]

  IH[Imported Hackathons] --> HP
  HP --> SG[Problem Signals]
  SG --> HR{Human review}
  HR -->|promote| P
  HR -->|reject / unknown| MEM[Historical memory]

  DB[(PostgreSQL workflow truth)] --> P
  DB --> IS
  DB --> PP
  SOL[(Solana financial truth)] --> IB
  SOL --> BB
  OBJ[(Object storage)] --> IS
  OBJ --> PS
